{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111755","id":2922819567,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6uNq_v","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111755","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111755.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111755.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111755","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111755/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111755/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111755/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/54b738dea4edf357cd8aba79e383e4f41ec4a276","number":111755,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Game View Plugin: Fix signal connected too early causing theme warning","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- *Fixed: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111751*\r\n\r\n**Issue Description**\r\n\r\nWhen we set `Toggle Selection Visibility` in `GameView`, there will save a project setting, named `hide_selection=true` in `user://.godot/editor/project/project_metadata.cfg`.\r\n\r\nWhen we restart editor, it will load `hide_selection` from project config, using this config to update button.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/60710df3b6fffb5a9a9479f80a0e9d8f05069946/editor/run/game_view_plugin.cpp#L1208-L1210\r\n\r\nAs we can see, the button already bind an event listener `_hide_selection_toggled`, to response when button toggled. So the init operation will trigger `_hide_selection_toggled` in `L1210`.\r\n\r\nActually, we didn't want to trigger event at initiating time, the event will be triggered later on `NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED`, so moved `connect` behind `set_press` can solve this issue.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo